
**`.gitignore`**
```gitignore
# Byte-compiled files
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Logs
logs/*.log
*.log

# Virtual environments
venv/
env/
.venv/

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak

# Coverage reports
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Profiling data
*.prof
*.lineprof

# Distribution / packaging
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# Test data
test_data/